The initial Ork fork is based on commit dbbc5fc7f35f548ef0477b0ac0fedb586788fb5a.
Ork changes the project identity and web app name, adds local setup commands,
allows upstream/main as a development migration baseline, and replaces the
active upstream automation with verification-only CI. Original workflows are
preserved in .github/upstream-workflows and are inactive there.
